の設定を指定なくても`set formatoptions-=cro` が効かなかったんですけど、neovimは設定ファイルに書かなくても`filetype plugin on` が効いているんですかね？","ts":"1614771274.357000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WGUx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"159d0d8d-e4fe-47dd-a363-1f1051dd5d4c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"個別なんですよね...","ts":"1614770913.354400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2kA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b88595d-8a28-4446-88d9-35330218c2e7","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"あとよくあるハマりポイントは `setlocal formatoptions-=ro` だと効かないことが多いとこですかね。thincaさんが書いてるように `setlocal formatoptions-=r formatoptions-=o` とばらけさせないといけない。","ts":"1614770666.354000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01M6S96ZLH","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VL4m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dafe4146-a2fa-4032-a2dd-54985a4d385e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私も似たような設定をしている","ts":"1614768486.352300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcf99ff5-9c62-48dc-8694-1635ec45f5d5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"うむ、filetypeプラグインがセットしてる例はよくある","ts":"1614768471.352000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01M6S96ZLH"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xy3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cb5b0e0-9ae0-47e2-bff0-88b820970a92","type":"message","user":"U01M6S96ZLH","text":"皆様ありがとうございました。","ts":"1614768136.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X67KM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39c6bad0-90eb-4014-81d9-6c4da8dbe49f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```filetype plugin indent on\n\naugroup vimrc-formatoptions\n  autocmd!\n